# !Klein environment configuration. Copy to `.env` (git-ignored) and adjust for your fleet.
# Loaded at startup by src/config/load-dotenv.ts; the real environment always wins over these.

# Per-device RAM (GB) for the §5.AB machine-aware model loader. When set, !Klein loads a task's
# model on a linked LM-Link device that FITS (weights + KV at context) instead of one that would
# swap and crash. Use the LM-Link device NAMES from `lms link status` — the local host's real name
# (e.g. m5max), or the alias "Local". Unset ⇒ the loader is off (byte-identical to before).
# For a discrete-GPU box, use its SYSTEM RAM (the swap-avoiding budget); the 25% reserve covers the OS.
NKLEIN_DEVICE_RAM_GB=m5max:128,m4mini:24,legion5pro:32
